# `.mutation-audit-inflight.json` was here. The mutation audit's in-flight record
# now lives under the system temp dir instead: its payload is the pristine text of
# the file being mutated, and this repo's own scanners read that text as findings,
# so its mere presence in the tree failed four tests and gave every mutation a
# false-failure floor. Ignoring it was never enough — the scanners do not consult
# this file. scripts/mutation-audit.ts refuses to run if the record would land
# inside the scanned tree.
